\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2   On a BBC program in July, he was shown drone video, apparently of prisoners in }{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 Xinjiang}
