{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2  crackdown. He has accused external forces of fomenting the protest movement in Hong Kong last year. He has praised China's coronavirus response and defended Huawei, the embattled Chinese tech company.}
